ap.
aamupäivällä
# aamulla "in the morning": Finnish postposes the day-part word after the
# clock ("kello 9 aamulla"), where it names the AM side of a 12-hour hour
# rather than a band of its own -- the same double duty aamupäivällä already
# does here and in daypart_aamu_fi.voc, which cites the surface.
aamulla
